kunzite: Adreno 710 step 10, the first write to the GMU (kgpu=10; 1-9 unchanged).
Only with the GMU's processor in reset (CM3_SYSRESET bit 0) and no firmware started
(FW_INIT_RESULT bit 8 clear): two words (0x600d0001, 0x0a110002) into DTCM 0x1c400 (0x3d71000),
read back, and the old words restored at once (logged writes, undone via the undo list). kgsl
gen7_gmu_load_fw loads firmware the same way. The per-entry undo becomes kg_undo_pop(),
shared with the end-of-run teardown.

diff --git a/bsd/dev/kunzite_adreno.c b/bsd/dev/kunzite_adreno.c
